  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring of Population Displacement, Strengthening Site Coordination and Management, and Providing Safe and Dignified Shelter Assistance in Eastern DRC.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC) continues to face multiple conflicts that have created one of the world&#x2019;s most complex and persistent crisis, which continues to be marked by extensive population displacement and a critical need for humanitarian assistance. Through this Action, IOM will provide lifesaving humanitarian support to displaced populations in eastern DRC through inteventions consisting of Displacement Tracking Matrix (DTM), Camp Coordination Camp Management (CCCM), and Dignified and safe shelter.</narrative>
  </description>
